{
    "id": "undo-redo-then-giving-up",
    "name": "Errors Then Recovery",
    "description": "Student has 3 consecutive error saves then fixes and has 5 clean saves. Pairs: (e,e),(e,e),(e,c),(c,c),(c,c),(c,c),(c,c). 2 error pairs score 11/11 each, rest score 0. EQ = (2*11/11)/7 = 2/7 ≈ 0.286.",
    "difficulty": "subtle",
    "tags": ["subtle", "recovery", "error-then-fix"],
